        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=13.45$",
          "worked": "Relative to $42^\\circ$, opposite $=9$ and hypotenuse $=x$. Use sine.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin\\theta&=\\frac{O}{H}\\\\\\sin42^\\circ&=\\frac{9}{x}\\\\x\\sin42^\\circ&=9\\\\x&=\\frac{9}{\\sin42^\\circ}\\\\x&\\approx13.45\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52,
        "responseSpace": "scaffold"
